              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ethĩwa mũndũ mũka eumwa nĩ nthakame yake mĩthenya mingĩ, na ti ĩvinda ya kwĩalũla kwake, kana ethĩwa eumwa ni nthakame kũvĩtũka ivinda ya kwĩalũla kwake; mĩthenya yonthe ya kumwa nthakame ya ũvuku wake akeethĩwa o ta mĩthenyanĩ ya kwĩalũla kwake: nĩ mũvuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
