              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũthenya wa nyanya akeeyosea ndumbũ ilĩ, kana maswii elĩ ma ĩvũĩ, na kũmũtwaĩa mũthembi, mũomonĩ wa ĩeema ya kũmbanĩa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũthembi akathembe yĩmwe yĩthĩwe nthembo ya naĩ, na yĩla yĩngĩ yĩthĩwe nthembo ya kũvĩvw’a; na mũthembi akamwĩw’anĩthya ũsu mbee wa Yeova kwondũ wa kumwa kwa nthakame yake kwa ũvuku wake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.30"
            ]
          }
        }
